message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SCS-Quantum: Frequency-Domain Wave-Packet Encoding with Hardware-Validated Quantum Bridge"
abstract: >-
  SCS-Quantum is a frequency-domain quantum encoding framework using 13 bands
  and wave-packet dynamics. Validated on IBM Heron r2 superconducting quantum processor
  (ibm_marrakesh) with Bell balance 99.3% and ideal GHZ states.
